are not asking you to buy anything. They&nbsp;
are trying to help you find a career that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:44.960
might change the world. The name comes&nbsp;
from the average number of hours someone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:49.120
spends working in their lifetime.&nbsp;
With all those hours on the line,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:54.560
it is worth devoting some time to thinking&nbsp;
about what you want to spend your career doing.

